<title>USA: Health Fitness boosted by acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Health Fitness boosted by acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Fitness Physical Therapy Inc on Monday said its improved performance in 1996 reflected strategic acquisitions and internal growth.</p>
<p>The company benefited from an 80 percent increase in revenues its preventive health-care business, which manages corporate and hospital-based fitness centers, it said.</p>
<p>For the full year, Health Fitness posted earnings of $0.14 per share compared with a 1995 loss of $0.04 per share. Total revenues rose to $28.5 million from $17.9 million.</p>
<p>Its shares were unchanged at 2-1/2 on Monday.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
